WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:33.416
Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:38.875
that He will explain to Arjuna that 
jñāna and vijñāna, after understanding

3
00:00:38.875 --> 00:00:43.333
which nothing will remain
 to be known in this world.

4
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:46.583
Now here, taking that same matter forward,

5
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.708
He is explaining the rarity

6
00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:51.083
of this knowledge in a very unique way.

7
00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:52.500
This will definitely make

8
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:56.208
Arjuna more eager to obtain this knowledge.

9
00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:02.625
In this verse,

10
00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.041
Lord Krishna says that

11
00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:08.750
among thousands of people, only one 
makes effort to attain perfection, and among

12
00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:15.583
those who attain perfection, 
only a few truly understand Him.

13
00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:17.500
Krishna is truly saying

14
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.458
that among countless beings,
 among innumerable humans, 

15
00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:23.125
almost all are trapped in material activities,

16
00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:26.250
attractions, and goals –

17
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:29.791
eating, sleeping, reproducing, first gathering

18
00:01:29.791 --> 00:01:31.250
material things,

19
00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.500
then trying to protect them.

20
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:38.791
"Manușyāņāṁ sahasreșu,"
meaning among thousands,

21
00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:43.041
only some people, rising from this materialism,

22
00:01:43.041 --> 00:01:47.208
set out in search of self-realization
 and spirituality.

23
00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:48.583
And for those who strive

24
00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:50.541
for this self-realization,

25
00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:52.541
Lord Krishna says

26
00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:55.041
"kaścid yatati siddhaye,"

27
00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:57.333
meaning among them too, only some people

28
00:01:57.333 --> 00:01:58.541
can reach the goal of

29
00:01:58.541 --> 00:02:01.625
self-realization and liberation.

30
00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:03.291
These are the same special people

31
00:02:03.291 --> 00:02:05.083
who consider this soul

32
00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:07.041
as their real existence,

33
00:02:07.041 --> 00:02:09.916
not this perishable body.

34
00:02:09.916 --> 00:02:11.666
And then Krishna says,

35
00:02:11.666 --> 00:02:14.416
"Yatatām api siddhānāṁ,"

36
00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:17.333
meaning those who attain perfection,

37
00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:18.958
among them too

38
00:02:18.958 --> 00:02:21.208
"kaścin māṁ vetti tattvataḥ,"

39
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:23.958
meaning among them too only one

40
00:02:23.958 --> 00:02:26.375
truly understands Me,

41
00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:29.125
meaning understands Me as I really am.

42
00:02:29.125 --> 00:02:30.458
Knowing Krishna completely

43
00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:32.541
in His true form is not some

44
00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:35.791
intellectual thought or conception.

45
00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:39.833
This is such deep and intimate knowledge

46
00:02:39.833 --> 00:02:42.958
that shows us His real form.

47
00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:43.875
Krishna, who is

48
00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:46.125
also the master of the universe,

49
00:02:46.125 --> 00:02:48.083
is also all-powerful,

50
00:02:48.083 --> 00:02:50.333
is also the destroyer of unrighteousness,

51
00:02:50.333 --> 00:02:54.791
and at the same time, loves
 His devotees immensely,

52
00:02:54.791 --> 00:02:57.083
is also pure-hearted.

53
00:02:57.083 --> 00:03:00.583
Many perfected people and practitioners 
understand the aspects of formless Brahman

54
00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:05.666
and supreme divine soul perfectly.

55
00:03:05.666 --> 00:03:08.166
but even among them, only some understand

56
00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:10.958
Krishna in that complete form of His,

57
00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:13.166
which attracts everyone,

58
00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:17.125
performs pastimes, takes care of devotees.

59
00:03:17.125 --> 00:03:20.666
Here, using the word "tattvataḥ," Lord Krishna

60
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:22.416
wants to say this –

61
00:03:22.416 --> 00:03:24.583
to attain Me,

62
00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:27.666
My complete form must be understood.

63
00:03:27.666 --> 00:03:30.208
If someone tries to understand
 Me through superficial knowledge

64
00:03:30.208 --> 00:03:32.416
or considering Me only as a concept

65
00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:35.458
or thought,

66
00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:39.041
then they can never know My complete form.

67
00:03:39.041 --> 00:03:41.250
Knowing Me personally

68
00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:43.000
is very rare,

69
00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.958
and perhaps only one among perfected

70
00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:48.666
people can do this.

71
00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:58.625
Among thousands who
 attain spiritual perfection,

72
00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:03.916
only some truly understand Me,

73
00:04:03.916 --> 00:04:07.041
and those who understand,

74
00:04:07.041 --> 00:04:09.708
then nothing remains for them

75
00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:14.291
to know in this entire world.

76
00:04:14.291 --> 00:04:16.750
The rarer the quest,

77
00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:19.208
the fewer the people.

78
00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:23.250
In this world too, it happens like this.

79
00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:26.291
Most people run after material pleasures,

80
00:04:26.291 --> 00:04:30.416
wealth, and honor.

81
00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:33.375
They do this because

82
00:04:33.375 --> 00:04:36.625
they see others doing the same,

83
00:04:36.625 --> 00:04:39.083
and this also seems easy.

84
00:04:39.083 --> 00:04:43.375
The entire crowd runs toward materialism.

85
00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:45.083
But

86
00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:47.833
those people are very rare

87
00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:52.291
who want to understand the real essence of life.

88
00:04:52.291 --> 00:04:54.833
Where ordinarily

89
00:04:54.833 --> 00:04:57.625
people spend their energy chasing

90
00:04:57.625 --> 00:05:01.583
perishable things, only

91
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:05.083
some people set out on the priceless

92
00:05:05.083 --> 00:05:11.541
quest of truth, love, and devotion.

93
00:05:11.541 --> 00:05:14.500
What do you want to do?

94
00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.833
Staying on the surface of materialism, 
do you want

95
00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:19.708
to keep struggling with waves of sorrow

96
00:05:19.708 --> 00:05:23.125
and trouble, or

97
00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:26.875
descending into the depth of spirituality's ocean,

98
00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:27.666
do you want to

99
00:05:27.666 --> 00:05:30.708
try to find pearls of truth?

100
00:05:30.708 --> 00:05:32.500
Remember,

101
00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.083
finding pearls is difficult,

102
00:05:35.083 --> 00:05:38.750
and this is what makes them priceless.

103
00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.208
Similarly, a life full of peace

104
00:05:41.208 --> 00:05:45.000
and love is also priceless,

105
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:48.416
and for this one must step away from the crowd,

106
00:05:48.416 --> 00:05:51.750
because true spirituality

107
00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.750
is not found in the crowd;

108
00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.250
this is only for those select people

109
00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:01.208
who, abandoning ego, walk on

110
00:06:01.208 --> 00:06:05.375
this path with devotion and surrender.

111
00:06:05.375 --> 00:06:07.833
And for this journey,

112
00:06:07.833 --> 00:06:10.250
this Bhagavad Gita

113
00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:13.416
is your map,

114
00:06:13.416 --> 00:06:18.208
and I, Krishna, myself 

115
00:06:18.208 --> 00:06:20.375
am your charioteer.

116
00:06:25.125 --> 00:06:27.541
In today's society,

117
00:06:27.541 --> 00:06:31.458
people often remain in search of convenience.

118
00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:36.000
Something that just makes life easy.

119
00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.500
Whether

120
00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.708
mutual relationships, their employment,

121
00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:45.375
or even spiritual knowledge.

122
00:06:45.375 --> 00:06:49.916
Most people search for superficial
 knowledge and simple paths

123
00:06:49.916 --> 00:06:54.791
instead of depth and hard work.

124
00:06:54.791 --> 00:07:01.583
The truth is that to obtain any high-grade thing,

125
00:07:01.583 --> 00:07:03.541
discipline is needed,

126
00:07:03.541 --> 00:07:06.458
dedication is needed, which

127
00:07:06.458 --> 00:07:09.125
will never be simple.

128
00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:13.166
True spirituality won't be obtained easily.

129
00:07:13.166 --> 00:07:16.041
It won't be obtained from material attractions, ego,

130
00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:20.583
and running in this worldly race.

131
00:07:20.583 --> 00:07:24.000
True spirituality will be obtained

132
00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.208
when you walk on this path
 with discipline and devotion,

133
00:07:27.208 --> 00:07:30.458
and in the mind

134
00:07:30.458 --> 00:07:38.541
there's a firm desire to obtain
 a deep relationship with me.

135
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:42.291
You must have definitely seen someone

136
00:07:42.291 --> 00:07:45.875
who is walking on the path of spirituality,

137
00:07:45.875 --> 00:07:48.458
is absorbed in devotion,

138
00:07:48.458 --> 00:07:52.416
or is desirous of walking on this path.

139
00:07:52.416 --> 00:07:56.875
But cannot get free from the
 clutches of materialism, 

140
00:07:56.875 --> 00:07:58.708
is struggling.

141
00:07:58.708 --> 00:08:02.791
Has started talking about
 spirituality and devotion?

142
00:08:02.791 --> 00:08:07.500
ordinarily a person
mocks someone else

143
00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:13.375
only to hide the hollowness inside themselves.

144
00:08:13.375 --> 00:08:16.375
Remember it!

145
00:08:21.875 --> 00:08:25.041
In professional life, most people

146
00:08:25.041 --> 00:08:29.791
work for material goals – someone
 wants to achieve success,

147
00:08:29.791 --> 00:08:32.000
someone wants to earn a big name,

148
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:32.875
or someone

149
00:08:32.875 --> 00:08:36.500
is working hard only for livelihood.

150
00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.541
All these purposes

151
00:08:38.541 --> 00:08:42.416
are absolutely appropriate in their place,

152
00:08:42.416 --> 00:08:44.875
but this is like

153
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:46.541
floating only on the surface of an ocean

154
00:08:46.541 --> 00:08:50.416
of sweet water.

155
00:08:50.416 --> 00:08:54.416
Only some rare people are such

156
00:08:54.416 --> 00:08:57.250
who search for depth

157
00:08:57.250 --> 00:09:00.375
and spiritual perspective in their work.

158
00:09:00.375 --> 00:09:04.791
Taste the sweetness of this water,
 and you cannot even imagine

159
00:09:04.791 --> 00:09:07.916
how spiritual this perspective can make

160
00:09:07.916 --> 00:09:11.666
an ordinary-seeming task.

161
00:09:11.666 --> 00:09:15.416
Perhaps you hadn't thought

162
00:09:15.416 --> 00:09:17.666
that your daily work

163
00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:21.750
can take you so close to spirituality.

164
00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:25.041
Connecting your work

165
00:09:25.041 --> 00:09:26.666
with the purpose of

166
00:09:26.666 --> 00:09:30.708
human welfare and service

167
00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:34.083
will not only transform your life,

168
00:09:34.083 --> 00:09:38.250
but will also inspire other people.

169
00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.333
Remember, true satisfaction comes

170
00:09:41.333 --> 00:09:44.708
not just from material success, but

171
00:09:44.708 --> 00:09:48.291
from the spiritual significance

172
00:09:48.291 --> 00:09:51.541
and spirit of service of your work.
